    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HomeStray </strong>is a heartfelt adventure-exploration game where you guide <strong>Omie</strong>, a lost puppy, across mysterious islands in search of his beloved <strong>Sophia</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/extras/a51d5c86e1f19b3d8fb9ffb40dd3b1ef.avif?t=1749797856\" data-has-big width=800 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop from island to island, solve puzzles, interact with charming creatures and NPCs. Discover new buddies along the way, each with <strong>special abilities</strong> that unlock new ways to navigate and interact with the world around you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/extras/4de351d66d61d9bb8626cc9620d6303e.avif?t=1749797856\" data-has-big width=800 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a touching story about the many meanings of &quot;<strong>home</strong>&quot; as you shape Omie's journey through your choices, which affect his mental growth and ultimately determine one of multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/extras/a270f9796d3bd5c0fac4f4c461e7144b.avif?t=1749797856\" data-has-big width=800 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HomeStray combines charming exploration with meaningful decisions in a world filled with both comedy and hidden depths, where every distraction reshapes what &quot;<strong>home</strong>&quot; truly means. <br> <br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather clues to find your way home.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make friends with other animals.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't be caught by human as a stray dog!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore multiple unique islands with diverse cultures and animals.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different endings based on your decisions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/extras/820f3641a09f1a0bb0a3172d985417e9.avif?t=1749797856\" data-has-big width=800 height=282 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/extras/9bc0042ec510a90c4c80747a45e8eb3e.webp?t=1749797856\" data-has-big width=800 height=8 /></span>\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Wishlist now</strong> to be the first to know when we launch!  <br>Your support means everything to us, and wishlisting helps more people discover this heartfelt story. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/extras/9bc0042ec510a90c4c80747a45e8eb3e.webp?t=1749797856\" data-has-big width=800 height=8 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce2 <strong>Follow us for sneak peeks, dev updates, and behind-the-scenes content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc26 X (Twitter)\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd8 Facebook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Instagram\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac Join our Discord\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s bring <strong>HomeStray</strong> to life together. See you on the journey home. \u2764\ufe0f\ud83d\udc36</p>",
